  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1306.02 Grant Priorities. A grant shall be awarded in a manner consistent with the priorities established in RSA 149-M:47 and RSA 149-M:49.\n\nSource. #7492, eff 5-18-01; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 1300); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 3006.02); ss by #10599, eff 7-1-14; ss by #13622, eff 5-1-23",
